OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient takes hospice
OL,4,Afunding plea to PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man living with stage-four cancer has
OL,7,Ftaken a petition signed by more than
OL,8,F103,000 people to Downing Street,
OL,9,Furging the Prime Minister to make
OL,10,Fhospice funding a national priority.
OL,12,FSteven Cooper received care at The
OL,13,FShakespeare Hospice in
OL,14,FStratford-upon-Avon and The Myton
OL,15,FHospice in Warwick after being told he
OL,16,Fonly had months, and then days to live.
OL,18,FHe delivered the petition on Tuesday
OL,19,Falongside hospice leaders, politicians
OL,20,Fand others whose lives have been
OL,21,Ftouched by hospice services.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
