OL,3,GNEWSACancer patient takes hospice
OL,4,Afunding plea to PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I wouldn't be alive if it
OL,7,Fwasn't for hospices - they need
OL,8,Ffunding. Hospices can help such a lot
OL,9,Fand can take the pressure off
OL,10,Fhospitals".
